     "en": "156 ÷ 2 gives remainders 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1 (from first to last division)."
    },
    {
     "en": "Reading upward: 156 = 10011100₂."
    },
    {
     "en": "0.625 × 2 = 1.25 → 1; 0.25 × 2 = 0.5 → 0; 0.5 × 2 = 1.0 → 1, so 0.625 = 0.101₂."
    },
    {
     "en": "Check: 128 + 16 + 8 + 4 = 156."
    }
   ],
   "answer": {
    "en": "(10011100.101)₂"
   },
